Package: m6APrediction
Title: Prediction of RNA m6A Modification Sites Using Random Forest
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R:
    person("Lingqin", "Meng",
           email = "Lingqin.Meng24@student.xjtlu.edu.cn.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides functions for predicting N6-methyladenosine
    (m6A) modification sites using a pre-trained random forest
    classifier. The package supports single-site and multiple-site
    predictions based on RNA sequence and biological features,
    returning predicted modification probabilities and statuses.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0),
    randomForest
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
